  "description": "3 Bedroom | 3 En-Suite Bedrooms | Parking for multiple cars | \nAn excellent opportunity to rent a spacious and well-presented three-bedroom home in the sought-after Frankfort Court development in Dublin 14.\nA particularly attractive feature of No. 11 is that all three bedrooms benefit from their own private en-suite bathroom, providing an excellent level of comfort and privacy. The property has extended into the south-facing garden and also has an additional living room off the kitchen, which can be used as a study room or home office. This makes the property particularly suitable for those looking for generous, high-quality accommodation.\nThe property has been freshly painted with floors varnished and is being offered unfurnished, allowing tenants to furnish and personalise the home to suit their own requirements.\nExternally, the property benefits from parking for multiple cars, a significant advantage in this highly convenient South Dublin location.\nFrankfort Court is an established residential development, ideally positioned for access to Dundrum, Rathfarnham and Dublin City Centre. Within walking distance of Dundrum Shopping Centre. Cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting and recreational amenities are within easy reach.\nThe area is well served by public transport with both Windy Arbour and Dundrum LUAS stops within 5-10 mins walk. Convenient access to the M50 and wider road network. \nKey Features\n•\tThree generous bedrooms\n•\tAll three bedrooms en-suite\n•\tOffered unfurnished\n•\tParking for multiple cars\n•\tSpacious and well-proportioned accommodation\n•\tSouth-facing garden with bike shed and garden shed\n•\tEstablished residential development\n•\tHighly sought-after Dublin 14 location\n•\tConvenient to Dundrum, City Centre and Sandyford\n•\tExcellent local amenities and transport connections\n•\tEasy access to the M50 and Dublin City Centre\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\nReferences and appropriate evidence of ability to meet the rental commitments will be required.",
